    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43048" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">scŏpus</span></b> , i, m.,
		= <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπός,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a goal</i>, <i>target</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">in pueri procul stantis, praebentisque pro
					scopo dispansam dextrae manūs palmam, sagittas
					direxit,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Suet. Dom. 19</span></i>
			 (dub.; Roth, scopulo; cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκοπός,</span> in trop. sense, <i><span class="en">Cic. Att.
				8, 11, 2</span></i>).</div>
